%% SEQ-P1-OV A4 REPORT — Overview Doctor->Cashier. OVERVIEW ONLY (error branches omitted).
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor DR as Doctor
    actor CA as Cashier
    participant FE as React SPA
    participant API as NestJS API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    DR->>FE: Open examination
    FE->>API: POST /visits/:id/open-examination
    API->>DB: Exam OPEN + Visit IN_EXAMINATION
    DR->>FE: Save diagnosis
    FE->>API: PATCH /examinations/:id
    API->>DB: update exam + diagnoses
    opt prescription
        DR->>FE: Add drugs
        FE->>API: PUT /examinations/:id/prescription
        API->>DB: prescription (price snapshot)
    end
    DR->>FE: Complete
    FE->>API: POST /examinations/:id/complete
    API->>DB: Exam + Visit COMPLETED
    CA->>FE: Issue invoice
    FE->>API: POST /visits/:id/invoice
    API->>DB: Invoice ISSUED + items
    CA->>FE: Record payment
    FE->>API: POST /invoices/:id/payments
    API->>DB: Payment + status update
